<title>USA: Hydelko names SKW as North America agent.</title>
<headline>Hydelko names SKW as North America agent.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hydelko, the Norwegian producer of master alloys and grain refiners for the aluminum industry, has named SKW Metals and Alloys Inc, part of Germany's SKW Trostberg AG, as its North American agent.</p>
<p>SKW will coordinate activities with Hydelko's U.S. office in Williamstown, W.Va.</p>
<p>((New York Commodities 212-859-1646))</p>
